        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Ground:  cream-colored satin.  All-over design, style of Jean Revel:  bunches of heavy fruits and flowers woven with several shades of pink, green, and yellow silk and tarnished gold and silver thread (metal wound on silk).  Selvedge with 6 cords.  Several pieces sewed together."@en ;
